     1,
     "<div>Hi folks,</div><div>I just installed the new 2.7.2 version of dartR from CRAN today.</div><div><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal\"><span><span><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal\"><span><span>When I try to run the following filter:<br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal\"><span><span>x2 &lt;- gl.filter.secondaries(x1, method = &quot;best&quot;)</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal\"><span><span><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal\"><span><span>I now get this error (which I wasn&#39;t getting previously for the same data set):</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal\"><span><span>\n\n<span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal\"><span><span>Error in strsplit(as.character(x2@other$loc.metrics$AlleleID), &quot;\\\\|&quot;) : \n  object &#39;x2&#39; not found</span></span></span> <br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal\"><span><span><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal\"><span><span>I don&#39;t get the error when I run:</span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal\"><span><span>\n<span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal\"><span><span>x2 &lt;- gl.filter.secondaries(x1, method = &quot;random&quot;)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal\"><span><span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal\"><span><span><br></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal\"><span><span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal\"><span><span>Not sure why this is occuring.</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal\"><span><span><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-style:normal\"><span><span>Peter<br></span></span></span>\n\n</span></span></span>\n\n</div>"
    ]
   ]
